-----Input-----

The first and only line of input contains a string S consisting of lower case alphabets.

-----Output-----

Print an integer denoting the sum of lengths of the substrings of the string S which are divisible by 2.

-----Constraints-----

1 ≤ |S| ≤ 10^5

-----Sample Input-----

abacaba

-----Sample Output-----

14

-----Explanation-----

All substrings of the string S which are divisible by 2 are

a, b, c, a, b, a, c, a, b, a, c, a, b, a

So, the sum of their lengths is 14.

